    "sql": "-- Analytical queries on the labeled order table (SQLite).\n-- Grain: one row per order. Target: returned (1/0).\n\n-- Overall return rate\nSELECT\n    COUNT(*) AS n_orders,\n    SUM(returned) AS n_returns,\n    AVG(returned) AS return_rate\nFROM orders"
